DESCRIPTION:Build a Windsor Continuous Arm Chair with chair maker and SBWI 
 founder Luke Barnett. Spend 7 days immersed in the world of green woodwork
 ing\, as we start with logs on Monday morning and finish with a continuous
  armchair on Saturday. Class will run through Sunday if you would like to 
  build a rocking chair or need a little extra time with your side chair.
SUMMARY:Windsor Continuous Arm Chair
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006MlpKAE
END:VEVENT
