DTEND:20270213T220000
DESCRIPTION:Learn the basics of caning in this one-day workshop. You will l
 earn the 6-Strand cane pattern\, one of the most common woven patterns for
  cane seating. This class will also include discussions regarding project 
 selection\, structural maintenance\, and repair strategies to ensure a sym
 metric and pleasant design. We will provide a frame for students to weave 
 their 6-stand cane pattern.
SUMMARY:The Basics of Caning
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006MsHKAU
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:7cb86b8b-a414-4c02-a36f-929722238960
DTSTART:20270227T140000
DTEND:20270228T210000
DESCRIPTION:This 2-day course will teach you the very fundamentals of turni
 ng and proper tool use.  With expert guidance\, you will learn how to safe
 ly and proficiently use a lathe while turning a variety of projects. Tool 
 sharpening\, materials selection and finishing will also be covered throug
 hout the course.
SUMMARY:Intro to Woodturning
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006MttKAE
END:VEVENT
