DTSTART:20270322T120000
DTEND:20270326T160000
DESCRIPTION:Build either a balloon back or fan back Windsor arm chair with 
 chair maker and SBWI founder Luke Barnett. Spend 5 days immersed in the wo
 rld of green woodworking\, as we start with logs on Monday morning and fin
 ish with a continuous armchair on Friday.
SUMMARY:Balloon Back or Fan Back Windsor
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006NgHKAU
END:VEVENT
