UID:416f8d0c-661f-4bca-9549-6d08c2aa221a
DTSTART:20271009T140000
DTEND:20271003T180000
DESCRIPTION:An exclusive one-day Lumber Grading course led by industry vete
 ran Bob Vogel\, former CEO of Hardwoods of Michigan. This intensive worksh
 op is designed to provide participants with a deep understanding of lumber
  grading principles and techniques\, equipping them with essential skills 
 for selecting and utilizing high-quality wood in woodworking projects.
SUMMARY:Comprehensive Lumber Grading
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006XJ3KAM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:1d89cb59-7fe0-4084-aba7-010387ac349e
DTSTART:20271011T120000
DTEND:20271015T210000
DESCRIPTION:In every piece of wood lies a story waiting to be revealed. Beg
 in with a vision\, embracing the depth of 3D imagination. Navigate the int
 ricacies of the grain\, wielding tools that are both sharp in edge and pur
 pose. In the dance of carving\, it is the blend of age-old design and mode
 rn mastery that crafts true brilliance
SUMMARY:Carving with a Classical Flare with Alexander Grabovetskiy
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006c5pKAA
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:b9eb7e6c-e887-4ac9-a8da-74ce99de68ab
DTSTART:20271016T130000
DTEND:20271017T200000
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Sam Beauford Woodworking Institute to make a uni
 que band saw box. Class is intended for those with limited to moderate woo
 dworking skills. We will design a box or students may choose a template pr
 ovided in class.
SUMMARY:Band Saw Boxes
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006XKfKAM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:69a07050-39ea-4abb-8f1f-24ff133c138d
DTSTART:20271016T130000
DTEND:20271016T210000
DESCRIPTION:Learn the basics of caning in this one-day workshop. You will l
 earn the 6-Strand cane pattern\, one of the most common woven patterns for
  cane seating. This class will also include discussions regarding project 
 selection\, structural maintenance\, and repair strategies to ensure a sym
 metric and pleasant design. We will provide a frame for students to weave 
 their 6-stand cane pattern.
SUMMARY:The Basics of Caning
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006XMHKA2
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:9beb1e7d-3eaf-4d77-8a74-d402648c43db
DTSTART:20271018T120000
DTEND:20271022T210000
DESCRIPTION:The music stand made in this class draws inspiration from the w
 orks of Wharton Esherick\, an iconic American artist renowned for his avan
 t-garde designs and organic forms. Over the course of 5 days\, students wi
 ll build their music stand entirely from start to finish\, shaping compone
 nts and cutting joinery by hand while also exploring elements of design.  
 Note: this is an intermediate class.  Some woodworking experience highly e
 ncouraged.
SUMMARY:Wharton Esherick Music Stand
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006XNtKAM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:84b3da1d-3b64-4636-b215-08559e565d72
DTSTART:20271023T130000
DTEND:20271024T210000
DESCRIPTION:Dive into the world of Mid Century Modern design with our Funky
  Footstool Workshop. In this two-day course\, you'll learn the foundationa
 l skills of woodworking and upholstery by constructing a replica of the Mi
 d Century Modern footstool designed by Victor Wilkins.
SUMMARY:Mid Century Funky Footstool
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006Xm5KAE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:f9e227e9-e0c5-4dc3-8a19-c9af8d6dce0b
DTSTART:20271024T120000
DTEND:20271024T210000
DESCRIPTION:Spend a day mastering the Shakers’ timeless method for bendin
 g thin wood into elegant oval boxes. Through live demonstrations and plent
 y of hands-on practice\, you’ll discover how heat and moisture make wood
  flexible\, then learn the precise steps for shaping\, fastening\, and fin
 ishing a matched set of three nesting boxes. No prior experience or tools 
 are required—all materials and equipment are provided.
SUMMARY:Shaker Oval Box
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006XqvKAE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:d8378ce5-4998-4e4f-ac33-d2cbe9de27c0
DTSTART:20271030T120000
DTEND:20271031T210000
DESCRIPTION:Over the course of this 2-day comprehensive class\, we will dem
 ystify how to make dovetails completely by hand. The first day will be spe
 nt cutting dovetails and pins and the second day will be dedicated to fitt
 ing joinery and constructing your project. This class is geared toward peo
 ple who have beginner woodworking skills and want to learn more advanced t
 echniques\, but students new to the woodshop are also welcome to join!
SUMMARY:Learn Dovetail Joinery
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006Xu9KAE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:27c717b8-9527-4cc5-a3d8-5b671456d19a
DTSTART:20271101T120000
DTEND:20271105T210000
DESCRIPTION:This 5-day class will teach you all the skills necessary to reu
 pholster furniture at home.  Students will gain an understanding of essent
 ial upholstery tools\, techniques\, and materials that can be used on a va
 riety of furniture.  By the end of the course\, students will learn how to
  finish projects with a clean and professional look. Plus\, you will get t
 o take home your chair!
SUMMARY:Mastering Upholstery: From Side Chairs to Arm Chairs
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006XvlKAE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:86e3cb74-88c6-4ea3-8013-90650237ca86
DTSTART:20271106T130000
DTEND:20271106T200000
DESCRIPTION:Learn scroll saw basics while creating a unique\, handcrafted o
 rnament - the perfect gift to loved ones or a little slice of holiday chee
 r. Students will learn scroll saw safety with proper blade tension\, how t
 o transfer a pattern\, proper techniques with cutting\, blade-entry holes\
 , and table squaring. Choose from a variety of ornament designs and create
  multiple pieces to take home. Milk paint will be available embellish to y
 our ornament
SUMMARY:Scroll Saw Ornaments
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006Y0bKAE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:59950ab1-31c7-45b6-8c76-43ba5f0c0e33
DTSTART:20271106T130000
DTEND:20271107T210000
DESCRIPTION:Learn the basics of bowl turning as you create simple side and 
 end-grain bowls followed by a more complex lidded box.  We'll begin with l
 athe safety\, basic wood science\, and a discussion of how bowl blanks can
  be made from logs in your own backyard. We will then move into turning si
 mple side grain bowls. Day two will introduce end grain bowl techniques\, 
 focused on a lidded box project or cup. No prior turning experience necess
 ary.
SUMMARY:Intro to Bowl Turning
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006c2bKAA
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:dea272bb-8c66-45fa-990a-dd51fdb9f7a4
DTSTART:20271107T140000
DTEND:20271107T210000
DESCRIPTION:The key to using hand tools correctly is a sharp edge - learn h
 ow the masters make it look so easy.  Join master woodworker and machinist
  Bob Goppold for a one day workshop on sharpening hand planes and chisels.
  Learn several techniques to make your hand plane and chisel edge “shavi
 ng sharp”.
SUMMARY:Sharpening Chisels & Planes
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006Y5RKAU
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:abd35393-35c9-4dba-9067-aa5681e6bb56
DTSTART:20271108T130000
DTEND:20271114T220000
DESCRIPTION:Design and build a Windsor chair with chairmaker Luke Barnett. 
 The process of making a Windsor chair is one of the most rewarding experie
 nces in woodworking. Whether or not you intend to stick with traditional c
 hair designs\, the skills you’ll gain in this class—riving\, hand-shap
 ing\, joinery\, steam bending\, and more—are foundational for any seriou
 s woodworker.
SUMMARY:Design Your Own Windsor Chair
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006Y73KAE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:9f252c4d-ed41-4aec-bc5d-8a7298b17ed6
DTSTART:20271115T130000
DTEND:20271119T220000
DESCRIPTION:Students will learn a variety of joinery\, their strengths and 
 weaknesses and how to implement them into furniture making and design. We 
 will first construct a simple box to store all of our new sample joints th
 en get right into the art and technique of wood joinery. This will be a co
 mbination of hand tool and machine joinery techniques.
SUMMARY:Hand Cut Joinery
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006Y8fKAE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:43b463af-a3aa-42a4-b912-26a27907c906
DTSTART:20271120T130000
DTEND:20271121T220000
DESCRIPTION:In this two-day class you will learn the complete process of bu
 ilding a custom picture frame. Over two days\, you'll mill a hardwood mite
 red frame\, fit a custom mat\, and even cut glass. Interior frame dimensio
 ns must be 30" or less on any side. Wood species available include Cherry 
 and Maple with an upcharge for Walnut.
SUMMARY:Custom Picture Framing
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V400000070ePKAQ
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:effdc323-c85c-401e-a5ac-4b1c9ad55c00
DTSTART:20271120T150000
DTEND:20271120T180000
DESCRIPTION:Do you have a nearly complete project at home that’s ready fo
 r that perfect finishing touch? (Or two? We all do!) Let’s tackle one to
 gether in this hands-on finishing workshop. We will demystify the many dif
 ferent wood finishes on the market and how to choose the right finish for 
 your project. You will learn best practices for surface preparation\, appl
 ication methods\, and achieving your desired aesthetics. 
SUMMARY:Finishing & Milk Paint Workshop
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006YAHKA2
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:26746975-b359-4226-8ed8-9fc6fb88e413
DTSTART:20271121T150000
DTEND:20271121T200000
DESCRIPTION:We’ll get that old dusty hand plane back into action in this 
 one day workshop! We will polish\, sharpen\, and tune up the body of your 
 hand plane to get it into user ready condition.
SUMMARY:Hand Plane Restoration
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006YBtKAM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:b26249ba-3d95-4b2a-b69f-6635c2551d6c
DTSTART:20271204T140000
DTEND:20271205T210000
DESCRIPTION:This 2-day course will teach you the very fundamentals of turni
 ng and proper tool use.  With expert guidance\, you will learn how to safe
 ly and proficiently use a lathe while turning a variety of projects. Tool 
 sharpening\, materials selection and finishing will also be covered throug
 hout the course.
SUMMARY:Intro to Woodturning
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006YF7KAM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:7301e5c2-0e97-44e3-8a09-3f2af332d4c1
DTSTART:20271204T150000
DTEND:20271204T210000
DESCRIPTION:Start your upholstery journey with this beginner-friendly and p
 ractical project: reupholstering a dining chair seat. This technique can b
 e applied to many types of furniture\, such as side chairs\, bar stools\, 
 ottomans\, headboards\, and more.
SUMMARY:Upholstery Basics: Reupholster a Dining Room Chair
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006YDVKA2
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261109T044320Z
UID:97e61576-3009-437f-a2e3-cdaf9b271ba9
DTSTART:20271206T130000
DTEND:20271212T220000
DESCRIPTION:Build a Windsor Continuous Arm Chair with chair maker and SBWI 
 founder Luke Barnett. Spend 7 days immersed in the world of green woodwork
 ing\, as we start with logs on Monday morning and finish with a continuous
  armchair on Saturday. Class will run through Sunday if you would like to 
  build a rocking chair or need a little extra time with your side chair.
SUMMARY:Windsor Continuous Arm Chair
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V400000075KjKAI
END:VEVENT
