DESCRIPTION:This class will focus on turning a gallery rim bowl\, a design 
 that features a raised\, wide\, or decorative rim. \n\n\n\nStudents will l
 earn essential bowl-turning techniques\, proper tool use\, and finishing m
 ethods while developing skills in rim design and detailing. By the end of 
 the course\, students will have completed a gallery rim bowl with their ch
 oice of decorative elements.
SUMMARY:Turn and Embellish a Gallery Rim Bowl with Greg Gallegos
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0V40000006eijKAA
END:VEVENT
